      "costUsd": 0.0066615,
      "pronunciationText": "Here's the whole method in five short steps. Draw it, link it, limit it, solve it, say it. Draw the shape, and name the variables with their units. Link them with the constraint, and write the quantity in one variable. Limit x to the values the real object allows. Solve with calculus, and compare with the ends, whether they're values or limits. Then say the answer the question asked for, with units."
